## Communication Guidelines

### Effective Communication Guidelines: Priorities and Practices

#### Value of Time and Clarity

Recognizing the importance of time and the need for clear communication is fundamental. We promote conversations and discussion over comments here in Linearapp, GitLab, or any other communication app. Avoid unnecessary meetings and discussions when possible.

#### Communication Tools

We utilize Discord and WhatsApp for efficient communication. You'll receive email invitations to join the relevant channels and groups.

#### Logging and Audit

Every communication should be recorded and subject to review, ensuring transparency and accountability.

#### Workplace Culture

Our environment is professional yet enjoyable. We encourage respect and teamwork, rejecting any forms of bullying or heroism.

#### Simplicity in Dialogue

Adopt a 'donkey' approach in conversations. The person initiating the discussion should simplify their language, promoting easy understanding for everyone.

#### Structured Communication Requests

Before any discussion, submit a communication request detailing the agenda, priority, and expected timeframe. This ensures focused and productive interactions.

